error[T0504] bigint.tov:2:13: can't mix `bigint` and `int` with `+`
    2 |   const a = x + 1
  why: a `bigint` only combines with another `bigint` (JavaScript throws a TypeError)
  fix[safe]: make it a bigint literal: `1n`

error[T0504] bigint.tov:3:13: can't mix `bigint` and `int` with `*`
    3 |   const b = x * n
  why: a `bigint` only combines with another `bigint` (JavaScript throws a TypeError)
  fix[maybe]: convert: `BigInt(n)`

error[T0504] bigint.tov:4:13: can't mix `bigint` and `f64` with `+`
    4 |   const c = x + d
  why: a `bigint` only combines with another `bigint` (JavaScript throws a TypeError)
  fix[maybe]: convert the bigint: `Number(x)`

error[T0501] bigint.tov:5:13: `>>>` doesn't apply to `bigint`: a bigint has no fixed width
    5 |   const e = x >>> 2n
  instead: `>>` (it rounds toward negative infinity), or `BigInt.asUintN(bits, x) >> n`

error[T0502] bigint.tov:9:13: this comparison is always false: `bigint` and `int` have no values in common
    9 |   const g = x === 0
